# Testing & Database Safety

## Databases

| DB | Connection | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `gloaming_backend` | `DATABASE_URL` in `apps/backend/.env` | Human development, manual debugging, local dev server |
| `gloaming_test` | `TEST_DATABASE_URL` in `apps/backend/.env.test` | Vitest integration/functional tests, AI automated tests |

**AI Agent:** may INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/RESET/SEED on `gloaming_test` only. **Never** use `gloaming_backend` for automated tests.

## Fail fast (no fallback)

If `TEST_DATABASE_URL` is missing or target is unclear → **STOP**. Do not guess. Do not fall back to `DATABASE_URL`.

```text
TEST_DATABASE_URL missing → pnpm test:backend fails immediately → no DB writes
```

Enforced in `apps/backend/tests/setup.ts` and `src/lib/env.ts` (`VITEST === 'true'`).

## Before any test or DB write

Read actual config — do not guess:

| Check | Stop if unknown |
| --- | --- |
| Test type | — |
| Needs real PostgreSQL? | — |
| Target DB name from connection string | **Yes** |
| Dedicated test DB (`gloaming_test`)? | **Yes** |
| Writes? | **Yes** |
| Cleanup strategy | **Yes** |

## Hard rules

| Forbidden on `gloaming_backend` | Required |
| --- | --- |
| Vitest / AI automated tests | Unit tests: mock; no `@/db` unless unavoidable |
| TRUNCATE, unscoped `DELETE`, DROP, reset, seed | Integration: `TEST_DATABASE_URL` → `gloaming_test` |
| `db:migrate` / `db:push` for test runs | Scoped cleanup: delete **only IDs this test created** |
| E2E against dev server + dev DB | Queue tests: memory Redis mock (see `tts-config`, `jobs` specs) |

**Backup + restore** — one-off high-risk ops only (migration verification), with user consent. Not routine test isolation.

## Wiring (SSOT)

| Concern | Location |
| --- | --- |
| Vitest boot | `vitest.config.ts` + `tests/setup.ts` + `env.ts` (`applyTestDatabaseEnv`) |
| Migrate test DB | `pnpm db:migrate:test` |
| Functional tests | `apps/backend/tests/functional/**` |

## AI workflow

1. Inspect env before `pnpm test`, SQL, migrate, seed, or API writes.
2. No test DB? Document setup; ask user — do not use dev DB.
3. New integration test: unique prefixes, track created IDs, scoped `afterAll`.
4. Manual verification on dev: read-only OK; writes need test DB or explicit approval.

## Forbidden defaults

```text
"Clear the database to verify" on gloaming_backend
Fallback to DATABASE_URL when TEST_DATABASE_URL is unset
Use developer accounts or hand-seeded data as test fixtures
Unscoped db.delete(table) in test cleanup
```
